text @[Shino]
text You're so much bigger now.
text @[Tomoya]
text Have we... met before?
sound P4N.aac
text @[Shino]
text Yes. But it's no surprise you don't remember.
sound P4O.aac
text @[Shino]
text You were still so small.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is that so...
sound P4P.aac
text @[Shino]
text Is that fool still busy paying for his crimes?
text @[Tomoya]
text No... I think he's back home now.
sound P4Q.aac
text @[Shino]
text He must have put you through a lot.
text @[Tomoya]
text No... We were both distant from one another...
sound P4R.aac
text @[Shino]
text I understand. This IS Naoyuki we're talking about, after all.
text Naoyuki... My father's name.
text I look out at the sea.
sound P4S.aac
text @[Shino]
text He didn't always used to be that stupid.
text My grandmother continues her story.
sound P4T.aac
text @[Shino]
text He married when he was young. They were both students, so everyone around them was against it...
sound P4U.aac
text @[Shino]
text But Naoyuki even dropped out of high school and began working... He did all he could for Atsuko-san.
sound P4V.aac
text @[Shino]
text The two of them began living in a small apartment...
sound P4W.aac
text @[Shino]
text He did everything in his power to make ends meet when they didn't have much money...
sound P4X.aac
text @[Shino]
text What was it that drove him forward, even in spite of all the hardship...?
sound P4Y.aac
text @[Shino]
text That's what we all wondered, at least.
sound P4Z.aac
text @[Shino]
text But Naoyuki must have been happy living that way.
sound P50.aac
text @[Shino]
text He looked happier than I had ever seen him during all of our years living together...
sound P51.aac
text @[Shino]
text He protected the love of his life and lived together with her, all through his own strength.
sound P52.aac
text @[Shino]
text That was enough to make him happy.
sound P53.aac
text @[Shino]
text Eventually, Atsuko-san found herself carrying Naoyuki's child.
sound P54.aac
text @[Shino]
text They lived a modest but blessed life, and that's when you came into the world.
sound P55.aac
text @[Shino]
text Their life together turned into life as a family.
sound P56.aac
text @[Shino]
text Naoyuki began to work even harder than before.
sound P57.aac
text @[Shino]
text And he was smiling the entire time.
