sound P58.aac
text @[Shino]
text But...
sound P59.aac
text @[Shino]
text That happiness didn't last for long.
sound P5A.aac
text @[Shino]
text Atsuko-san got in an accident...
sound P5B.aac
text @[Shino]
text ...and passed away, just like that.
sound P5C.aac
text @[Shino]
text For Naoyuki... the tragedy was so much that he could never recover from it.
sound P5D.aac
text @[Shino]
text He lived to protect his family. To keep them happy.
sound P5E.aac
text @[Shino]
text But he couldn't give in to despair yet.
sound P5F.aac
text @[Shino]
text Tomoya-san.
sound P5G.aac
text @[Shino]
text ...It was because he had been left with you, a young child.
