sound P5J.aac
text @[Shino]
text Do you remember that?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound P5K.aac
text @[Shino]
text After that... he began to work harder than he ever had before.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound P5L.aac
text @[Shino]
text It was difficult to both work and raise a child.
sound P5M.aac
text @[Shino]
text He was fired again and again, and had to go from job to job...
sound P5N.aac
text @[Shino]
text Yet he still refused to give you up...
sound P5O.aac
text @[Shino]
text He used the meager amounts of money he DID have to buy you toys and candy...
sound P5P.aac
text @[Shino]
text He sacrified everything... His own luck, chances to succeed...
sound P5Q.aac
text @[Shino]
text All to raise you.
sound P5R.aac
text @[Shino]
text I'm sure he was strict at times. And I'm sure he was rough at others.
sound P5S.aac
text @[Shino]
text But... it was all to make sure you grew up to be a good person.
sound P5T.aac
text @[Shino]
text And when he had raised you to be an independent boy...
sound P5U.aac
text @[Shino]
text He'd lost everything.
sound P5V.aac
text @[Shino]
text His job...
sound P5W.aac
text @[Shino]
text His credibility...
sound P5X.aac
text @[Shino]
text His luck...
sound P5Y.aac
text @[Shino]
text His friends...
sound P5Z.aac
text @[Shino]
text From there...
