text Always selfish and reckless...
sound P65.aac
text @[Shino]
text He's a failure of a person...
sound P66.aac
text @[Shino]
text But...
sound P67.aac
text @[Shino]
text There's just one thing about him... that I still feel proud of:
sound P68.aac
text @[Shino]
text He may have been a failure of a person...
sound P69.aac
text @[Shino]
text But he was splendid as a father.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
